372 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (    Decatur, Georgia is an independent city located in DeKalb County. To the west and south of the city, Decatur borders the city of Atlanta. To the east it borders Avondale Estates, and the rest of the city is bordered by unincorporated DeKalb County. Decatur has historically benefited from its location, as residents were able to travel quickly to and from Atlanta; first by streetcar and later by automobiles and MARTA. While walking around the city, it is easy to see how its history has influenced its character and, but it is also clear that the city is taking an active role in shaping the current land use patterns of the city \(City of Decatur\). )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
