/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (    As mentioned above, the PATH foundation has already worked within the AOI. Increasing their collaboration and presence will help with our objectives. PATH is a great private public partnership opportunity that Atlanta is very familiar with. )
/E (    As mentioned above, the PATH foundation has already worked within the AOI. Increasing their collaboration and presence will help with our objectives. PATH is a great private public partnership opportunity that Atlanta is very familiar with. )
