/T (   This smart growth scenario addresses smart growth land use principles through the objectives of the scenario. Our plan looks to increase density, provide mixed use opportunities, and encourage infill. Our plan does not address the history of Decatur or lean into historical developments. )
/E (   This smart growth scenario addresses smart growth land use principles through the objectives of the scenario. Our plan looks to increase density, provide mixed use opportunities, and encourage infill. Our plan does not address the history of Decatur or lean into historical developments. )
